#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Routing and URL generation"
msgstr "Roteamento e geração de URLs"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Usually, a Yii application processes certain requests with certain handlers.  It selects a handler based on the request URL.  The part of the application that does the job is a router, and the process of selecting a handler, instantiating it and running a handler method is *routing*."
msgstr "Normalmente, uma aplicação Yii processa certas requisições com certos handlers.  Ela escolhe o handler com base na URL da requisição.  A parte da aplicação que faz esse trabalho é o router, e o processo de escolher um handler, instanciá-lo e executar um método dele é o *roteamento*."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The reverse process of routing is *URL generation*, which creates a URL from a given named route, route arguments, and query parameters.  When you later request the created URL, the routing process can resolve it back into the original route arguments and query parameters."
msgstr "O processo inverso do roteamento é a *geração de URLs*, que cria uma URL a partir de uma rota nomeada, de argumentos de rota e de parâmetros de query.  Quando você requisita depois a URL criada, o roteamento consegue convertê-la de volta nos argumentos de rota e parâmetros de query originais."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Routing and URL generation are separate services, but they use a common set of routes for both URL matching and URL generation."
msgstr "Roteamento e geração de URLs são serviços separados, mas usam o mesmo conjunto de rotas tanto para casar URLs quanto para gerá-las."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring routes"
msgstr "Configurando rotas"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "By configuring routes, you can let your application recognize arbitrary URL formats without modifying your existing application code. You can configure routes in `/config/routes.php`. The structure of the file is the following:"
msgstr "Configurando rotas, você faz a aplicação reconhecer formatos arbitrários de URL sem modificar o código existente. Você pode configurar as rotas em `/config/routes.php`. A estrutura do arquivo é a seguinte:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'index'])\n"
"        ->name('site/index')\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'index'])\n"
"        ->name('site/index')\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The file returns an array of routes. When defining a route, you start with a method corresponding to a certain HTTP request type:"
msgstr "O arquivo retorna um array de rotas. Ao definir uma rota, você começa com um método que corresponde a um tipo de requisição HTTP:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "get"
msgstr "get"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "post"
msgstr "post"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "put"
msgstr "put"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "delete"
msgstr "delete"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "patch"
msgstr "patch"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "head"
msgstr "head"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "options"
msgstr "options"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "If you need many methods, you can use `methods()`:"
msgstr "Se você precisar de vários métodos, pode usar `methods()`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/user/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'user'])\n"
"        ->name('site/user')\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/user/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'user'])\n"
"        ->name('site/user')\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "All these methods accept a route pattern.  The route pattern defines how the router matches the URL when routing and how it generates URL based on route name and parameters.  You will learn about the actual syntax later in this guide.  Specify a handler with `action()` as:"
msgstr "Todos esses métodos aceitam um padrão de rota.  O padrão de rota define como o router casa a URL durante o roteamento e como gera a URL a partir do nome da rota e dos parâmetros.  Você vai conhecer a sintaxe mais adiante neste guia.  Defina o handler com `action()` como:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "[Middleware](../structure/middleware.md) class name."
msgstr "Nome de uma classe de [middleware](../structure/middleware.md)."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Handler action (an array of [HandlerClass, handlerMethod])."
msgstr "Uma action de handler (um array no formato [HandlerClass, handlerMethod])."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "A callable."
msgstr "Um callable."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "In case of a handler action, a class of type `HandlerClass` is instantiated and its `handlerMethod` is called:"
msgstr "No caso de uma action de handler, uma classe do tipo `HandlerClass` é instanciada e o seu método `handlerMethod` é chamado:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class HandlerClass\n"
"{\n"
"    public function handle(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class HandlerClass\n"
"{\n"
"    public function handle(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The callable is called as is:"
msgstr "O callable é chamado como está:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"static function (ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $next) use ($responseFactory) {\n"
"    $response = $responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"    $response->getBody()->write('You are at homepage.');\n"
"    return $response;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"static function (ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $next) use ($responseFactory) {\n"
"    $response = $responseFactory->createResponse();\n"
"    $response->getBody()->write('You are at homepage.');\n"
"    return $response;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "For handler action and callable typed parameters are automatically injected using the dependency injection container passed to the route."
msgstr "Para actions de handler e callables, os parâmetros tipados são injetados automaticamente pelo container de injeção de dependência passado para a rota."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Get current request and handler by type-hinting for `ServerRequestInterface` and `RequestHandlerInterface`."
msgstr "Obtenha a requisição e o handler atuais usando os type hints `ServerRequestInterface` e `RequestHandlerInterface`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Route arguments in actions"
msgstr "Argumentos de rota nas actions"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Named route parameters are stored in `CurrentRoute`.  To pass a route parameter to an action method parameter, use the `RouteArgument` attribute:"
msgstr "Os parâmetros nomeados da rota ficam guardados em `CurrentRoute`.  Para passar um parâmetro de rota para um parâmetro do método da action, use o atributo `RouteArgument`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/post/{id:\\d+}')\n"
"        ->action([PostController::class, 'view'])\n"
"        ->name('post/view')\n"
"];\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostController\n"
"{\n"
"    public function view(#[RouteArgument('id')] int $id): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        // $id contains the value from the {id} route parameter.\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\HydratorAttribute\\RouteArgument;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/post/{id:\\d+}')\n"
"        ->action([PostController::class, 'view'])\n"
"        ->name('post/view')\n"
"];\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostController\n"
"{\n"
"    public function view(#[RouteArgument('id')] int $id): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        // $id contains the value from the {id} route parameter.\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "If a parameter has the same name as the action parameter, you can omit the attribute name:"
msgstr "Se o parâmetro tiver o mesmo nome do parâmetro da action, você pode omitir o nome no atributo:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function view(#[RouteArgument] int $id): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    // ...\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function view(#[RouteArgument] int $id): ResponseInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    // ...\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You can also inject `CurrentRoute` into an action or a service when you need several arguments or route metadata:"
msgstr "Você também pode injetar `CurrentRoute` em uma action ou em um serviço quando precisar de vários argumentos ou de metadados da rota:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostController\n"
"{\n"
"    public function view(CurrentRoute $currentRoute): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = $currentRoute->getArgument('id');\n"
"        $routeName = $currentRoute->getName();\n"
"\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostController\n"
"{\n"
"    public function view(CurrentRoute $currentRoute): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = $currentRoute->getArgument('id');\n"
"        $routeName = $currentRoute->getName();\n"
"\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Route arguments aren't request attributes.  Read them from `CurrentRoute` or action parameters marked with `RouteArgument`."
msgstr "Argumentos de rota não são atributos da requisição.  Leia-os de `CurrentRoute` ou de parâmetros da action marcados com `RouteArgument`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "For optional route parameters, provide a default value either in the route with `defaults()` or in the action method signature."
msgstr "Para parâmetros de rota opcionais, informe um valor padrão na rota com `defaults()` ou na assinatura do método da action."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You could add extra handlers to wrap primary one with `middleware()` method:"
msgstr "Você pode adicionar handlers extras em volta do principal com o método `middleware()`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET], '/download/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([DownloadController::class, 'download'])\n"
"        ->name('download/id')\n"
"        ->middleware(LimitDownloadRate::class)\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET], '/download/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([DownloadController::class, 'download'])\n"
"        ->name('download/id')\n"
"        ->middleware(LimitDownloadRate::class)\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Check [\"the middleware\"](../structure/middleware.md) guide to learn more about how to implement middleware."
msgstr "Veja o guia sobre [\"middleware\"](../structure/middleware.md) para saber mais sobre como implementar middlewares."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "This is especially useful when grouping routes:"
msgstr "Isso é especialmente útil ao agrupar rotas:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/api')\n"
"        ->middleware(ApiDataWrapper::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/info/v2')\n"
"                ->action(ApiInfo::class)\n"
"                ->name('api/info/v2')\n"
"                ->middleware(JsonDataResponseMiddleware::class),\n"
"            Route::get('/user')\n"
"                ->action([ApiUserController::class, 'index'])\n"
"                ->name('api/user/index'),\n"
"            Route::get('/user/{login}')\n"
"                ->action([ApiUserController::class, 'profile'])\n"
"                ->middleware(JsonDataResponseMiddleware::class)\n"
"                ->name('api/user/profile'),\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/api')\n"
"        ->middleware(ApiDataWrapper::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/info/v2')\n"
"                ->action(ApiInfo::class)\n"
"                ->name('api/info/v2')\n"
"                ->middleware(JsonDataResponseMiddleware::class),\n"
"            Route::get('/user')\n"
"                ->action([ApiUserController::class, 'index'])\n"
"                ->name('api/user/index'),\n"
"            Route::get('/user/{login}')\n"
"                ->action([ApiUserController::class, 'profile'])\n"
"                ->middleware(JsonDataResponseMiddleware::class)\n"
"                ->name('api/user/profile'),\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Router executes `ApiDataWrapper` before handling any URL starting with `/api`."
msgstr "O router executa `ApiDataWrapper` antes de tratar qualquer URL que comece com `/api`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You could name a route with a `name()` method. It's a good idea to choose a route name based on the handler's name."
msgstr "Você pode dar um nome a uma rota com o método `name()`. É uma boa ideia escolher o nome da rota com base no nome do handler."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You can set a default value for a route parameter. For example:"
msgstr "Você pode definir um valor padrão para um parâmetro de rota. Por exemplo:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/user[/{id}]')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'user'])\n"
"        ->name('site/user')\n"
"        ->defaults(['id' => '42'])\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\SiteController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/user[/{id}]')\n"
"        ->action([SiteController::class, 'user'])\n"
"        ->name('site/user')\n"
"        ->defaults(['id' => '42'])\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "This configuration would result in a match with both `/user` and `/user/123`.  In both cases `CurrentRoute` service will contain `id` argument filled.  In the first case it will be default `42` and in the second case it will be `123`."
msgstr "Essa configuração casa tanto com `/user` quanto com `/user/123`.  Nos dois casos, o serviço `CurrentRoute` vai ter o argumento `id` preenchido.  No primeiro caso, ele será o padrão `42` e, no segundo, `123`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "In cause URL should be valid for a single host, you can specify it with `host()`."
msgstr "Se a URL só deve valer para um host, você pode defini-lo com `host()`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md ../src/guide/start/databases.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Roteamento"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Yii routing is flexible, and internally it may use different routing implementations.  The actual matching algorithm may vary, but the basic idea stays the same."
msgstr "O roteamento do Yii é flexível e, internamente, pode usar diferentes implementações.  O algoritmo de casamento pode variar, mas a ideia básica é a mesma."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Router matches routes defined in config from top to bottom.  If there is a match, further matching isn't performed and the router executes the route handler to get the response.  If there is no match at all, router passes handling to the next middleware in the [application middleware set](../structure/middleware.md)."
msgstr "O router casa as rotas definidas na configuração de cima para baixo.  Se houver um casamento, ele para de procurar e executa o handler da rota para obter a resposta.  Se nenhuma rota casar, o router passa o tratamento para o próximo middleware do [conjunto de middlewares da aplicação](../structure/middleware.md)."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic OPTIONS responses"
msgstr "Respostas OPTIONS automáticas"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "When the request path matches a route but the HTTP method doesn't, router returns a `405 Method Not Allowed` response with an `Allow` header:"
msgstr "Quando o caminho da requisição casa com uma rota, mas o método HTTP não, o router retorna uma resposta `405 Method Not Allowed` com o header `Allow`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (http)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HTTP/1.1 405 Method Not Allowed\n"
"Allow: GET\n"
msgstr ""
"HTTP/1.1 405 Method Not Allowed\n"
"Allow: GET\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "For an `OPTIONS` request to the same path, router returns an empty `204 No Content` response with the same `Allow` header:"
msgstr "Para uma requisição `OPTIONS` no mesmo caminho, o router retorna uma resposta vazia `204 No Content` com o mesmo header `Allow`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (http)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HTTP/1.1 204 No Content\n"
"Allow: GET\n"
msgstr ""
"HTTP/1.1 204 No Content\n"
"Allow: GET\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "This response is generated from the configured routes before the route action runs.  If an API endpoint needs CORS headers, attach CORS middleware to a route group:"
msgstr "Essa resposta é gerada a partir das rotas configuradas, antes de a action da rota ser executada.  Se um endpoint de API precisar de headers CORS, adicione um middleware de CORS a um grupo de rotas:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Api\\CorsMiddleware;\n"
"use App\\Api\\PostController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/api')\n"
"        ->withCors(CorsMiddleware::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/posts')\n"
"                ->action([PostController::class, 'index'])\n"
"                ->name('api/posts')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Api\\CorsMiddleware;\n"
"use App\\Api\\PostController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Method;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/api')\n"
"        ->withCors(CorsMiddleware::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::methods([Method::GET, Method::POST], '/posts')\n"
"                ->action([PostController::class, 'index'])\n"
"                ->name('api/posts')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating URLs"
msgstr "Gerando URLs"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "To generate URL based on a route, a route should have a name:"
msgstr "Para gerar uma URL a partir de uma rota, a rota precisa ter um nome:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\TestController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/test')\n"
"        ->action([TestController::class, 'index'])\n"
"        ->name('test/index'),\n"
"    Route::post('/test/submit/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([TestController::class, 'submit'])\n"
"        ->name('test/submit')\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Controller\\TestController;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Route::get('/test')\n"
"        ->action([TestController::class, 'index'])\n"
"        ->name('test/index'),\n"
"    Route::post('/test/submit/{id}')\n"
"        ->action([TestController::class, 'submit'])\n"
"        ->name('test/submit')\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The generation looks like the following:"
msgstr "A geração fica assim:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class TestController extends AbstractController\n"
"{\n"
"    protected function name(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return 'test';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function index(UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $url = $urlGenerator->generate('test/submit', ['id' => '42']);\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class TestController extends AbstractController\n"
"{\n"
"    protected function name(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return 'test';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function index(UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $url = $urlGenerator->generate('test/submit', ['id' => '42']);\n"
"        // ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "In the above code, we get a generator instance with the help of [automatic dependency injection](../concept/di-container.md)  that works with action handlers.  In another service, you can get the instance with similar constructor injection.  In views URL generator is available as `$url`."
msgstr "No código acima, obtemos uma instância do gerador com a ajuda da [injeção de dependência automática](../concept/di-container.md), que funciona com handlers de action.  Em outro serviço, você pode obter a instância com uma injeção no construtor parecida.  Nas views, o gerador de URLs está disponível como `$url`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Then we use `generate()` method to get the actual URL.  It accepts a route name, route arguments, query parameters, and a hash fragment.  The code will return `/test/submit/42`."
msgstr "Depois usamos o método `generate()` para obter a URL.  Ele aceita o nome da rota, argumentos de rota, parâmetros de query e um fragmento (hash).  O código retorna `/test/submit/42`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Route arguments are used to fill placeholders in the route pattern.  Arguments that aren't used in the pattern are added to the query string when the query parameters array doesn't already contain the same name:"
msgstr "Os argumentos de rota preenchem os placeholders do padrão da rota.  Os argumentos que não aparecem no padrão são adicionados à query string, desde que o array de parâmetros de query ainda não tenha o mesmo nome:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generate(\n"
"    'test/submit',\n"
"    ['id' => '42', 'utm' => 'newsletter'],\n"
"    ['page' => '1']\n"
");\n"
"// $url is \"/test/submit/42?page=1&utm=newsletter\".\n"
msgstr ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generate(\n"
"    'test/submit',\n"
"    ['id' => '42', 'utm' => 'newsletter'],\n"
"    ['page' => '1']\n"
");\n"
"// $url is \"/test/submit/42?page=1&utm=newsletter\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "If you need absolute URL, use `generateAbsolute()` instead."
msgstr "Se você precisar de uma URL absoluta, use `generateAbsolute()`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating URL from the current route"
msgstr "Gerando a URL a partir da rota atual"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Use `generateFromCurrent()` when a link should keep the current route and most of its arguments.  For example, a detail page can link to another page number while keeping the current route name and `id` argument:"
msgstr "Use `generateFromCurrent()` quando um link deve manter a rota atual e a maior parte dos seus argumentos.  Por exemplo, uma página de detalhes pode apontar para outro número de página mantendo o nome da rota atual e o argumento `id`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$url = $urlGenerator->generateFromCurrent(['page' => '2']);\n"
msgstr "$url = $urlGenerator->generateFromCurrent(['page' => '2']);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The method also keeps query parameters from the current request.  Pass explicit query parameters when a link should replace or add query string values."
msgstr "O método também mantém os parâmetros de query da requisição atual.  Passe parâmetros de query explícitos quando o link precisar substituir ou adicionar valores na query string."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locale-based URLs"
msgstr "URLs com locale"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "When the locale is part of the URL path, define it as a route argument.  For a Yii application with routes in `config/common/routes.php`, wrap localized routes in a group with a locale parameter:"
msgstr "Quando o locale faz parte do caminho da URL, defina-o como um argumento de rota.  Em uma aplicação Yii com as rotas em `config/common/routes.php`, coloque as rotas localizadas em um grupo com um parâmetro de locale:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Web\\HomePage\\Action as HomePageAction;\n"
"use App\\Web\\Post\\ViewAction as PostViewAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/{_locale:en-US|de}')\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(HomePageAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('home'),\n"
"            Route::get('/posts/{slug}')\n"
"                ->action(PostViewAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('post/view')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Web\\HomePage\\Action as HomePageAction;\n"
"use App\\Web\\Post\\ViewAction as PostViewAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/{_locale:en-US|de}')\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(HomePageAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('home'),\n"
"            Route::get('/posts/{slug}')\n"
"                ->action(PostViewAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('post/view')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "The route `/de/posts/welcome` matches the `post/view` route and stores `_locale` as a route argument with the `de` value."
msgstr "A rota `/de/posts/welcome` casa com a rota `post/view` e guarda `_locale` como argumento de rota com o valor `de`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "In middleware that chooses the request locale, read this argument from `CurrentRoute`:"
msgstr "No middleware que escolhe o locale da requisição, leia esse argumento de `CurrentRoute`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Middleware;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\RequestHandlerInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\TranslatorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class LocaleMiddleware implements MiddlewareInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    private const DEFAULT_LOCALE = 'en-US';\n"
"\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private CurrentRoute $currentRoute,\n"
"        private TranslatorInterface $translator,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"        private WebView $view,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $locale = $this->currentRoute->getArgument('_locale', self::DEFAULT_LOCALE);\n"
"\n"
"        $this->translator->setLocale($locale);\n"
"        $this->view->setLocale($locale);\n"
"        $this->urlGenerator->setDefaultArgument('_locale', $locale);\n"
"\n"
"        return $handler->handle($request);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Middleware;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\MiddlewareInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Server\\RequestHandlerInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\TranslatorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class LocaleMiddleware implements MiddlewareInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    private const DEFAULT_LOCALE = 'en-US';\n"
"\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private CurrentRoute $currentRoute,\n"
"        private TranslatorInterface $translator,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"        private WebView $view,\n"
"    ) {}\n"
"\n"
"    public function process(ServerRequestInterface $request, RequestHandlerInterface $handler): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $locale = $this->currentRoute->getArgument('_locale', self::DEFAULT_LOCALE);\n"
"\n"
"        $this->translator->setLocale($locale);\n"
"        $this->view->setLocale($locale);\n"
"        $this->urlGenerator->setDefaultArgument('_locale', $locale);\n"
"\n"
"        return $handler->handle($request);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Register this middleware in the localized route group before the route action:"
msgstr "Registre esse middleware no grupo de rotas localizadas, antes da action da rota:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use App\\Web\\HomePage\\Action as HomePageAction;\n"
"use App\\Web\\Middleware\\LocaleMiddleware;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/{_locale:en-US|de}')\n"
"        ->middleware(LocaleMiddleware::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(HomePageAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('home')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use App\\Web\\HomePage\\Action as HomePageAction;\n"
"use App\\Web\\Middleware\\LocaleMiddleware;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/{_locale:en-US|de}')\n"
"        ->middleware(LocaleMiddleware::class)\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(HomePageAction::class)\n"
"                ->name('home')\n"
"        )\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "After the middleware sets the default `_locale` argument, URL generation can omit it:"
msgstr "Depois que o middleware define o argumento padrão `_locale`, a geração de URLs pode omiti-lo:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['slug' => 'welcome']);\n"
"// On a German page, $url is \"/de/posts/welcome\".\n"
msgstr ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['slug' => 'welcome']);\n"
"// On a German page, $url is \"/de/posts/welcome\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "For a language switcher, use `generateFromCurrent()` and replace only the locale argument:"
msgstr "Para um seletor de idioma, use `generateFromCurrent()` e substitua apenas o argumento de locale:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generateFromCurrent(\n"
"    ['_locale' => 'en-US'],\n"
"    fallbackRouteName: 'home'\n"
");\n"
msgstr ""
"$url = $urlGenerator->generateFromCurrent(\n"
"    ['_locale' => 'en-US'],\n"
"    fallbackRouteName: 'home'\n"
");\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Route patterns"
msgstr "Padrões de rota"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Route patterns used depend on the underlying implementation used.  The default implementation is [nikic/FastRoute](https://github.com/nikic/FastRoute)."
msgstr "Os padrões de rota dependem da implementação usada por baixo.  A implementação padrão é o [nikic/FastRoute](https://github.com/nikic/FastRoute)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Basic patterns are static like `/test`. That means they must match exactly in order for a route match."
msgstr "Os padrões básicos são estáticos, como `/test`. Isso significa que eles precisam casar exatamente para a rota ser escolhida."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Named Parameters"
msgstr "Parâmetros nomeados"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "A pattern can include one or more named parameters which are specified in the pattern in the format of `{ParamName:RegExp}`, where `ParamName` specifies the parameter name and `RegExp` is an optional regular expression used to match parameter values.  If `RegExp` isn't specified, it means the parameter value should be a string without any slash."
msgstr "Um padrão pode ter um ou mais parâmetros nomeados, escritos no formato `{ParamName:RegExp}`, onde `ParamName` é o nome do parâmetro e `RegExp` é uma expressão regular opcional usada para casar o valor.  Se `RegExp` não for informada, o valor do parâmetro deve ser uma string sem barras."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> You can only use regular expressions inside parameters. The rest of the pattern is considered plain text.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> Você só pode usar expressões regulares dentro dos parâmetros. O resto do padrão é tratado como texto puro.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You can't use capturing groups. For example `{lang:(en|de)}` isn't a valid placeholder, because `()` is a capturing group. Instead, you can use either `{lang:en|de}` or `{lang:(?:en|de)}`."
msgstr "Você não pode usar grupos de captura. Por exemplo, `{lang:(en|de)}` não é um placeholder válido, porque `()` é um grupo de captura. Em vez disso, use `{lang:en|de}` ou `{lang:(?:en|de)}`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "On a route match router fills `CurrentRoute` arguments with values matching the corresponding parts of the URL.  When you use the rule to create a URL, it will take the values of the provided parameters and insert them at the places where the parameters are declared."
msgstr "Quando uma rota casa, o router preenche os argumentos de `CurrentRoute` com os valores das partes correspondentes da URL.  Quando você usa a regra para criar uma URL, ela pega os valores dos parâmetros informados e os insere nas posições onde os parâmetros foram declarados."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Let's use some examples to illustrate how named parameters work. Assume you've declared the following three patterns:"
msgstr "Vamos usar alguns exemplos para mostrar como os parâmetros nomeados funcionam. Suponha que você declarou os três padrões a seguir:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`'posts/{year:\\d{4}}/{category}`"
msgstr "`'posts/{year:\\d{4}}/{category}`"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`'posts'`"
msgstr "`'posts'`"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`'post/{id:\\d+}'`"
msgstr "`'post/{id:\\d+}'`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`/posts` match the second pattern;"
msgstr "`/posts` casa com o segundo padrão;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`/posts/2014/php` match a first pattern. Parameters are the `year` whose value is 2014 and the `category` whose value is `php`;"
msgstr "`/posts/2014/php` casa com o primeiro padrão. Os parâmetros são `year`, com valor 2014, e `category`, com valor `php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`/post/100` match a third pattern. The `id` parameter value is 100;"
msgstr "`/post/100` casa com o terceiro padrão. O valor do parâmetro `id` é 100;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "`/posts/php` doesn't match."
msgstr "`/posts/php` não casa."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "When generating URLs, you should use the following parameters:"
msgstr "Ao gerar URLs, você deve usar os seguintes parâmetros:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo $url->generate('first', ['year' => '2020', 'category' => 'Virology']);\n"
"echo $url->generate('second');\n"
"echo $url->generate('third', ['id' => '42']);\n"
msgstr ""
"echo $url->generate('first', ['year' => '2020', 'category' => 'Virology']);\n"
"echo $url->generate('second');\n"
"echo $url->generate('third', ['id' => '42']);\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional parts"
msgstr "Partes opcionais"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "You should wrap optional pattern parts with `[` and `]`.  For example, `/posts[/{id}]` pattern would match both `http://example.com/posts` and `http://example.com/posts/42`.  Router would fill `id` argument of `CurrentRoute` service in the second case only.  In this case, you could specify the default value:"
msgstr "Coloque as partes opcionais do padrão entre `[` e `]`.  Por exemplo, o padrão `/posts[/{id}]` casa tanto com `http://example.com/posts` quanto com `http://example.com/posts/42`.  O router só preenche o argumento `id` do serviço `CurrentRoute` no segundo caso.  Nesse caso, você pode definir o valor padrão:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use \\Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"Route::get('/posts[/{id}]')->defaults(['id' => '1']);\n"
msgstr ""
"use \\Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"Route::get('/posts[/{id}]')->defaults(['id' => '1']);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/runtime/routing.md
msgid "Optional parts are only supported in a trailing position, not in the middle of a route."
msgstr "Partes opcionais só são suportadas no final da rota, não no meio dela."
